# The `sim` sidecar's image (environment/docker-compose.yaml builds it): the base image (the simulator and the
# benchmark's adapter at /opt/abc-tools), this directory at /srv (the frozen instance and the task's text), and
# the shared layer from the pinned files-only image. .dockerignore keeps the build's own two files out of /srv.
